Changes: TVM host adapter removed; device selection and page mapping unchanged.
RTP uses the same FP32 variant for its FP32 score tensor. SGLang's FP4 indexer
uses the separate BF16 variant, which this adapter must not silently emulate
by narrowing RTP's scores. Header is launched through the existing PPU JIT ABI.

